### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Bookstore API — every endpoint, happy paths and error cases.
### IntelliJ: open this file and click ▶ next to a request (app must be running:
###   ./gradlew :04-spring-boot-basics:bootRun).
### Requests further down change data (create/patch/delete/order). Delete
### build/bookstore.db and restart to get the seed data back.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@host = http://localhost:8080

### ── Books: read (lesson 02) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List books, first page of 2
GET {{host}}/api/books?page=0&size=2

### One book
GET {{host}}/api/books/1

### 404 — unknown book (Problem Details JSON, lesson 03)
GET {{host}}/api/books/999

### 400 — negative page (method validation on @RequestParam)
GET {{host}}/api/books?page=-1

### ── Books: write ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 201 Created + Location header
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Children of Dune", "authorId": 1, "isbn": "9780593098240", "priceCents": 1399}

### 400 — validation errors per field
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": " ", "authorId": 1, "isbn": "123", "priceCents": -5}

### 400 — missing required field (Jackson + Kotlin non-null)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"authorId": 1}

### 400 — not JSON at all
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

not json

### 409 — duplicate ISBN
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Dune again", "authorId": 1, "isbn": "9780441172719", "priceCents": 100}

### 404 — unknown author
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Ghost", "authorId": 42, "isbn": "9999999999999", "priceCents": 100}

### PATCH — change only the price
PATCH {{host}}/api/books/3
Content-Type: application/json

{"priceCents": 999}

### 405 — PUT is not supported (see the Allow header)
PUT {{host}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### DELETE — 204 No Content (book 6 = the one created above)
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/6

### ── Orders: transactions (lesson 06) ─────────────────────────────────────────

### 201 — order 2 × Dune + 1 × Pride and Prejudice
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ada@example.com", "lines": [{"bookId": 1, "quantity": 2}, {"bookId": 3, "quantity": 1}]}

### 409 — Emma is out of stock → the whole order rolls back (Dune's stock unchanged)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "bob@example.com", "lines": [{"bookId": 1, "quantity": 1}, {"bookId": 4, "quantity": 1}]}

### Check: Dune's stock after the failed order
GET {{host}}/api/books/1

### 400 — nested validation errors (lines[0].bookId, lines[0].quantity, customerEmail)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "nope", "lines": [{"bookId": 0, "quantity": 500}]}

### ── Actuator (lesson 08) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Which actuator endpoints are exposed
GET {{host}}/actuator

### Health with all components (db, diskSpace, lowStock, …)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness probe
GET {{host}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Info
GET {{host}}/actuator/info

### Flyway migrations applied
GET {{host}}/actuator/flyway

### HTTP request metrics
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests

### Only the 409 responses of POST /api/orders
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests?tag=uri:/api/orders&tag=status:409

### Connection pool usage
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/hikaricp.connections.active
